match(0,'Architectures & virtualization','Match each concept to its description.',[['Hypervisor','Hosts virtual machines'],['Container','Isolated process environment sharing a kernel'],['VRF','Separate Layer 3 routing context'],['Public cloud','Provider-hosted computing services']],'Virtualization can separate operating environments, routing contexts or infrastructure consumption; these are different forms of abstraction.','virtual')
